!! Learning paths

* [[G-buffer examples|G-Buffer Index]] - depth, normals, world-position reconstruction, and deferred lighting.
* [[Material examples|Materials Index]] - Fresnel reflection, PBR, and parallax occlusion mapping.
* [[Procedural geometry|Procedural Mesh Index]] - mesh construction and instanced vertex transforms.
* [[Interactive demos|Interactive Demos Index]] - explore axes/UV mapping and the animated ripple effect.
* [[Interactive ripple shader explanation|interactive/interact_5/CODE_EXPLANATION.md]] - detailed walkthrough of the shader and wave math.
* [[Particle positions and colors|particles/particle_1/CODE_EXPLANATION.md]] - generate static pseudo-random offsets and colors.
* [[Animated particles|particles/particle_2/CODE_EXPLANATION.md]] - move particles toward pseudo-random targets over time.
* [[Animated scanlines|uv/uv_4/CODE_EXPLANATION.md]] - use screen-space coordinates and a sine wave to darken a texture.

